      "writtenOn": "2018-12-07T15:40:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This parses strings based on ISO-6709 format, as written in below,\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/master/media/java/android/media/MediaMetadataRetriever.java#864\n\n     * The location should be specified according to ISO-6709 standard, under\n     * a mp4/3gp box \"@xyz\". Location with longitude of -90 degrees and latitude\n     * of 180 degrees will be retrieved as \"-90.0000+180.0000\", for instance.\n\nIf strings has above format, this works correctly.\n\nRef: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_6709#String_expression_(Annex_H)",
      "parentUuid": "c40c5ff7_3834043e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 167,
        "startChar": 75,
        "endLine": 167,
        "endChar": 82
      },
